### Performance Tips

```ts
// Batch operations when adding/removing many objects
canvas.renderOnAddRemove = false;
// ... many canvas.add/remove ...
canvas.requestRenderAll();
```

Keep object count reasonable; prefer grouping, caching where appropriate.

